Description: The brand colors of the Center for Alaska Native Health
    Research (CANHR) for R graphics: the colors as hex codes, 'ggplot2'
    color and fill scales, and a matching 'ggplot2' theme. A companion Stata
    graph scheme is available from the package's GitHub repository.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://rdazadda.github.io/CANHR-color-schemes/,
